{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 4,
  "name": "山水蒙",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00530",
              "text": "蒙。亨。匪我求童蒙，童蒙求我。初筮告，再三渎，渎则不告。利贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00530",
                "bodyParagraph": 466
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00531",
              "text": "象曰：山下出泉，蒙。君子以果行育德。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00531",
                "bodyParagraph": 467
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00533",
              "text": "蒙卦：通泰。不是我有求于幼稚愚昧的人，而是幼稚愚昧的人有求于我。第一次占筮，神灵告诉了他。轻慢不敬的再三占筮，轻慢不敬的占筮，神灵就不会告诉他。但还是吉利的卜问。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00533",
                "bodyParagraph": 469
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00534",
              "text": "《象辞》说：上卦为艮，象征山；下卦为坎，象征泉。山下有泉，泉水喷涌而出，这是蒙卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于一往无前的山泉，从而以果敢坚毅的行动来培养自身的品德。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00534",
                "bodyParagraph": 470
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00536",
              "text": "蒙卦艮上坎下，为离宫四世卦。蒙即蒙昧，主回还往复，疑惑不前，多忧愁过失，乃是凶卦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00536",
                "bodyParagraph": 472
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00538",
              "text": "智慧未开，蒙昧闭塞；犹豫不决，缺乏果断。 得此卦者，智慧犹如童蒙，不辨是非，迷失方向；若能顺贤师良友之教，启其聪明则亨通。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00538",
                "bodyParagraph": 474
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00540",
              "text": "时运：蓄积德行，出而用世。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00540",
                "bodyParagraph": 476
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00541",
              "text": "财运：矿山生意，果决则吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00541",
                "bodyParagraph": 477
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00542",
              "text": "家宅：君子居吉；婚姻之始。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00542",
                "bodyParagraph": 478
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00543",
              "text": "身体：驱去邪热，可保平安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00543",
                "bodyParagraph": 479
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00545",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下坎上艮）相叠，艮是山的形象，喻止；坎是水的形象，喻险。卦形为山下有险，仍不停止前进，是为蒙昧，故称蒙卦。但因把握时机，行动切合时宜，因此，具有启蒙和通达的卦象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00545",
                "bodyParagraph": 481
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00546",
              "text": "大象：蒙者，昏而无所见也，故宜「启蒙」。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00546",
                "bodyParagraph": 482
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00547",
              "text": "运势：初时迷惑不知方向，须忍耐待机而动，凡事多听取别人意见，则运可通。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00547",
                "bodyParagraph": 483
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00548",
              "text": "事业：事业开始，混乱无序，危机四伏，以勇敢坚毅的行动可以扭转局面。然而必须接受严格教育，培养这种奋发图强的精神。务必脚踏实地，最忌好高骛远，否则会陷入孤立无援的境地。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00548",
                "bodyParagraph": 484
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00549",
              "text": "经商：务必小心谨慎，不得急功近利，尤其应树立高尚的商业道德，以良好的信誉提高竞争力而取胜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00549",
                "bodyParagraph": 485
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00550",
              "text": "求名：必须接受良好的基础教育，陶冶情操。且动机纯正，可以达到目的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00550",
                "bodyParagraph": 486
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00551",
              "text": "婚恋：注意考察对方品德，不可以金钱为诱铒。夫妻需相互宽容、理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00551",
                "bodyParagraph": 487
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00552",
              "text": "决策：有时会陷入迷惘困顿的境地，加上胆小、不果断，往往误事。如能接受长辈的教诲，甚至严酷的考验，抛弃疑惧的心理，等待适当时机，必然一帆风顺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00552",
                "bodyParagraph": 488
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00554",
              "text": "蒙卦是教育启蒙的智慧，艮为山，坎为泉，山下出泉。泉水始流出山，则必将渐汇成江河,正如蒙稚渐启，又山下有险，因为有险停止不前，所以蒙昧不明。事物发展的初期阶段，必然蒙昧，所以教育是当务之急，养学生纯正无邪的品质，是治蒙之道。蒙卦，这个卦是异卦相叠，下卦为坎，上卦为艮。艮是山的形象，喻止；坎是水的形象，喻险。卦形为山下有险，仍不停止前进，是为蒙昧，故称蒙卦。但因把握时机，行动切合时宜;因此，具有启蒙和通达的卦象。《蒙》卦是《屯》卦这个始生卦之后的第二卦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00554",
                "bodyParagraph": 490
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00555",
              "text": "《序卦》中说：“物生必蒙，故受之以蒙。蒙者，蒙也，特之稚也。”物之幼稚阶段，有如蒙昧未开的状态，在人则是指童蒙。《象》中这样解释蒙卦：山下出泉，蒙；君子以果行育德。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00555",
                "bodyParagraph": 491
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00558",
              "text": "初六。发蒙，利用刑人，用说桎梏。以往，吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00558",
                "bodyParagraph": 494
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00559",
              "text": "象曰：利用刑人，以正法也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00559",
                "bodyParagraph": 495
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00561",
              "text": "初六：启蒙教育，教育学生开发生产，教师用受刑之人作榜样，给犯人脱去手铐脚镣。往前走有困难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00561",
                "bodyParagraph": 497
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00562",
              "text": "《象辞》说：以刑罚惩治罪人是有利的，可以以此来整肃法纪。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00562",
                "bodyParagraph": 498
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00564",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，多有官诉，亲朋不和，多争斗，终能脱解。做官的为教育之职，或为司法系统之职。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00564",
                "bodyParagraph": 500
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00566",
              "text": "时运：求荣反辱，收敛自己。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00566",
                "bodyParagraph": 502
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00567",
              "text": "财运：避免兴讼，得理即止。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00567",
                "bodyParagraph": 503
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00568",
              "text": "家宅：谨慎持家；可能罢婚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00568",
                "bodyParagraph": 504
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00569",
              "text": "身体：恐有外伤。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00569",
                "bodyParagraph": 505
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00571",
              "text": "初六爻动变得周易第41卦：山泽损。这个卦是异卦（下兑上艮）相叠。艮为山；兑为泽。上山下泽，大泽浸蚀山根。损益相间，损中有益，益中有损。二者之间，不可不慎重对待。损下益上，治理国家，过度会损伤国基。应损则损，但必量力、适度。少损而益最佳。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00571",
                "bodyParagraph": 507
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00573",
              "text": "蒙卦第一爻，爻辞：初六：发蒙，利用刑人，用说桎梏。以往吝。初六：发蒙，利用刑人，用说桎梏。以往吝。爻辞释义 刑人：刑是“型”的古文，就是古代制造陶器用的坯模或铸器用的沙范，“刑”在这里可以理解为规范、强行引正，是一种教育。桎梏：木制刑具。说：同“脱”。本爻辞的意思是说：启发蒙昧，适宜向人们宣传刑罚规定，以此来规范人们的行为，借此教育人们不去做违法犯罪之事，脱离那些桎梏之苦。如果有人不专心学习这些就前去行事，将来会陷入困难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00573",
                "bodyParagraph": 509
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00574",
              "text": "从卦象上看，初六这一爻以阴爻居于刚位，失位。而且没有居中，属于失中，做事冒进，不守正道，像不太懂事的孩子一样乱闯乱动。初六上承九二，九二像师长一样，对其严加管束，适时惩戒，使其走上正道。这样长大后就会遵纪守法，摆脱牢狱之灾。否则，若是任其发展，日后会铸成大错而后悔不及。初六这一爻启示的是教育人的一种方法，可以说是榜样的作用，但是采用的是榜样的对立一面：坏典型的作用，由此来警醒人们。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00574",
                "bodyParagraph": 510
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00575",
              "text": "比如为了教育人不要违法，向他们宣讲法律法规，还让他们去看一看违法犯罪之人的下场，对他们说道：“如果你一旦犯法，就会像他们一样，戴上手铐脚镣。”通过这种方式，劝诫人们遵纪守法。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00575",
                "bodyParagraph": 511
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00578",
              "text": "九二。包蒙吉。纳妇吉。子克家。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00578",
                "bodyParagraph": 514
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00579",
              "text": "象曰：子克家，刚柔接也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00579",
                "bodyParagraph": 515
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00581",
              "text": "九二：教育包容，这是吉兆。筮遇此爻，娶迎妻子，吉利。男女能相配成家。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00581",
                "bodyParagraph": 517
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00582",
              "text": "《象辞》说：男女相配成家，因为九二、六三两爻相近，表示阴阳刚柔相交会。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00582",
                "bodyParagraph": 518
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00584",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，人情和合，百事有成，或结婚，或生子孙，有财有福。做官的会守住官职。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00584",
                "bodyParagraph": 520
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00586",
              "text": "时运：有财有福，子可继业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00586",
                "bodyParagraph": 522
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00587",
              "text": "财运：广纳财物，售至外地。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00587",
                "bodyParagraph": 523
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00588",
              "text": "家宅：妻贤子孝，可振家业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00588",
                "bodyParagraph": 524
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00589",
              "text": "身体：柔软体操。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00589",
                "bodyParagraph": 525
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00591",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第23卦：山地剥。这个卦是异卦（下坤上艮）相叠。五阴在下，一阳在上，阴盛而阳孤；高山附于地。二者都是剥落象，故为“剥卦”。此卦阴盛阳衰，喻小人得势，君子困顿，事业败坏。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00591",
                "bodyParagraph": 527
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00594",
              "text": "六三。勿用娶女，见金夫，不有躬。无攸利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00594",
                "bodyParagraph": 530
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00595",
              "text": "象曰：勿用娶女，行不顺也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00595",
                "bodyParagraph": 531
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00597",
              "text": "六三：不要抢劫女子为婚，会遭到武装者的抵抗，丢掉性命，没有什么好处。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00597",
                "bodyParagraph": 533
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00598",
              "text": "《象辞》说：不能聘娶女子，六三之爻居于九二之上，这是以柔乘刚之象，象征着以女虐男，这是悖逆不顺的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00598",
                "bodyParagraph": 534
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00600",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，会生是非，小则破财，大则伤身。做官的会因为贪婪而自取其辱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00600",
                "bodyParagraph": 536
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00602",
              "text": "时运：见财忘义，声名破败。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00602",
                "bodyParagraph": 538
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00603",
              "text": "财运：小则破财，大则伤身。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00603",
                "bodyParagraph": 539
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00604",
              "text": "家宅：妻强夫弱，恐有不安；不宜婚嫁。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00604",
                "bodyParagraph": 540
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00605",
              "text": "身体：小心饮食。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00605",
                "bodyParagraph": 541
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00607",
              "text": "六三爻动变得周易第18卦：山风蛊。这个卦是异卦（下巽上艮）相叠，与随卦互为综卦。蛊本意为事，引申为多事、混乱。器皿久不用而生虫称“蛊”，喻天下久安而因循、腐败，必须革新创造，治理整顿，挽救危机，重振事业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00607",
                "bodyParagraph": 543
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00609",
              "text": "六三：勿用取女，见金夫，不有躬。无攸利。爻辞释义 取：娶。不有躬：失身。 本爻辞的意思是说：不要娶这样的女子。她见到有钱人，就会失身。娶她是没有任何好处的。 从卦象上看，六三属于阴爻居于阳位，失位，而且不能居中。此爻的断语是“无攸利”，指没有任何利益。娶一个拜金的女子，遇到有钱的男人就自失其身的女人，对婚姻是有害无益的。妻子对孩子的影响很大，一个不贤惠的妻子，会把家庭搞得一团糟，这对孩子的成长会产生不良的影响，所以是“无攸利”的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00609",
                "bodyParagraph": 545
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00610",
              "text": "《象》曰：“勿用取女”，行不顺也。解释过来就是：“不能娶这个女子”，主要是指这个女子的行为是不合乎礼仪的，即这个女子没有受过良好的启蒙教育。所以在娶妻时，注意要娶受到教育或有好的家教的女子。 占得此卦者，若是搞教育的老师或是父母，要注意自己学生或孩子的早恋问题。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00610",
                "bodyParagraph": 546
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00613",
              "text": "六四。困蒙，吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00613",
                "bodyParagraph": 549
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00614",
              "text": "象曰：困蒙之吝，独远实也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00614",
                "bodyParagraph": 550
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00616",
              "text": "六四：教育脱困，太可惜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00616",
                "bodyParagraph": 552
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00617",
              "text": "《象辞》说：为蒙昧无知所困扰，因为离群索居，远离生活。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00617",
                "bodyParagraph": 553
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00619",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，人情淡薄，经营受阻。静无灾，动有损。做官的因为无人赏识而难以晋升。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00619",
                "bodyParagraph": 555
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00621",
              "text": "时运：远水近火，无济于事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00621",
                "bodyParagraph": 557
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00622",
              "text": "财运：缺乏资本，难免穷困。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00622",
                "bodyParagraph": 558
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00623",
              "text": "家宅：地处偏僻，生活困苦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00623",
                "bodyParagraph": 559
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00624",
              "text": "身体：体质虚弱，阴寒之症。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00624",
                "bodyParagraph": 560
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00626",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第64卦：火水未济。这个卦是异卦（下坎上离）相叠。离为火，坎为水。火上水下，火势压倒水势，救火大功未成，故称未济。《周易》以乾坤二卦为始，以既济、未济二卦为终，充分反映了变化发展的思想。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00626",
                "bodyParagraph": 562
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00628",
              "text": "蒙卦第四爻，爻辞：六四：困蒙，吝。 六四：困蒙，吝。爻辞释义",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00628",
                "bodyParagraph": 564
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00629",
              "text": "本爻辞的意思是：困在蒙昧之中，有困难。蒙卦第四爻人生启示 蒙卦之中，包括两种类型的人，一种是启蒙者，一种是蒙昧的人。阳爻所代表的是启蒙者，而阴爻所代表的则是蒙昧的人。我们看六四这一爻，虽然它是阴爻占柔位，属于得位，但是看看它上下，全都是阴爻，而它远离了九二和上九两个阳爻，困于蒙昧之中，求告无门，无法行动，所以陷入困难之中。四爻上下全是阴爻，同性相斥，并且处于艮卦的下面像被一座山压着，自然难逃被困的命运了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00629",
                "bodyParagraph": 565
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0007"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00630",
              "text": "在蒙卦中，阴爻代表蒙昧，六四被同性所困，不能与阳爻相合相应，所以被困。不过由于六四得位，所以不会有凶险，只是有些忧吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00630",
                "bodyParagraph": 566
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00633",
              "text": "六五。童蒙，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00633",
                "bodyParagraph": 569
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00634",
              "text": "象曰：童蒙之吉，顺以巽也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00634",
                "bodyParagraph": 570
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00636",
              "text": "六五：教育少年儿童，吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00636",
                "bodyParagraph": 572
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00637",
              "text": "《象辞》说：幼稚蒙昧的人之所以吉利，是因为柔顺服从。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00637",
                "bodyParagraph": 573
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00639",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，依附贵人、良师者百事顺遂，谋望可成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00639",
                "bodyParagraph": 575
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00641",
              "text": "时运：功名未成，得良师则吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00641",
                "bodyParagraph": 577
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00642",
              "text": "财运：无法独立，须靠人经营。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00642",
                "bodyParagraph": 578
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00643",
              "text": "家宅：幼年定亲。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00643",
                "bodyParagraph": 579
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00644",
              "text": "身体：听人指导锻炼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00644",
                "bodyParagraph": 580
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00646",
              "text": "六五爻动变得周易第59卦：风水涣。这个卦是异卦（下坎上巽）相叠。风在水上行，推波助澜，四方流溢。涣，水流流散之意。象征组织和人心涣散，必须用积极的手段和方法克服，战胜弊端，挽救涣散，转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00646",
                "bodyParagraph": 582
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00652",
              "text": "上九。击蒙。不利为寇，利御寇。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00652",
                "bodyParagraph": 588
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00653",
              "text": "象曰：利用御寇，上下顺也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00653",
                "bodyParagraph": 589
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00655",
              "text": "上九：教育击打，不应当作匪寇，而要抵御匪寇。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00655",
                "bodyParagraph": 591
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00656",
              "text": "《象辞》说：有利于防御盗寇，因为上九阳爻居于一卦之首，说明臣下顺从拥戴。防御盗寇之举，获得众人支持，必能胜利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00656",
                "bodyParagraph": 592
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00658",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜守旧，须谨防争讼，寇盗之扰。做官的会有司寇之名职。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00658",
                "bodyParagraph": 594
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00660",
              "text": "时运：宜守不宜攻，与人和睦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00660",
                "bodyParagraph": 596
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00661",
              "text": "财运：顺取为宜，买卖相洽。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00661",
                "bodyParagraph": 597
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00662",
              "text": "家宅：妇道贵顺，家道和平。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00662",
                "bodyParagraph": 598
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00663",
              "text": "身体：保养为宜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00663",
                "bodyParagraph": 599
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00665",
              "text": "上九爻动变得周易第7卦：地水师。这个卦是异卦（下坎上坤）相叠。“师”指军队。坎为水、为险；坤为地、为顺，喻寓兵于农。兵凶战危，用兵乃圣人不得已而为之，但它可以顺利无阻碍地解决矛盾，因为顺乎形势，师出有名，故能化凶为吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00665",
                "bodyParagraph": 601
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-00667",
              "text": "蒙卦第六爻，爻辞：上九：击蒙，不利为宼，利御宼。 上九：击蒙，不利为宼，利御宼。爻辞释义 这句爻辞的意思是说：启蒙教育要及早实行，要针对蒙童的缺点，先发制人。不要等到蒙童的问题彻底暴露再去教育，而要防患于未然，事先进行启蒙教",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00667",
                "bodyParagraph": 603
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-00668",
              "text": "《象》曰：“利用御宼”，上下顺也。也就是说到了孩子教育的问题，启蒙教育要及早实行，要针对蒙童的缺点，先发制人。孩子小时候是一张白纸，如果你不给他打上好的色彩，他很容易被其他颜色污染。孩子如果教育不好，类似于贼宼一样的思想可能会影响他，把他带坏，他成了像贼宼一样危害社会的人。如果教育得当，把正义的思想教授给他，他可能就会成为抵制贼宼的、有利于社会的好人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-00668",
                "bodyParagraph": 604
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0008"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 2
}
